nk\" href=\"/\"><img src=\"https://files.ihgbrands.com/assets_brightluxx-logo-nav.png\" alt=\"Brightluxx\"/></a><nav class=\"site-nav\" aria-label=\"Primary navigation\"><button data-testid=\"nav-products\">PRODUCTS <span>⌄</span></button><button data-testid=\"nav-solutions\">SOLUTIONS <span>⌄</span></button><a data-testid=\"nav-lumimorph\" href=\"/lumimorph\">LUMIMORPH</a><a data-testid=\"nav-naturatex\" href=\"/naturatex\">NATURATEX</a><a data-testid=\"nav-signatouch\" href=\"/signatouch\">SIGNATOUCH</a><a data-testid=\"nav-glassmorph\" href=\"/glassmorph\">GLASSMORPH</a><button data-testid=\"nav-more-btn\">☰ <span>⌄</span></button></nav><button class=\"mobile-menu-button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"Toggle navigation\" data-testid=\"mobile-menu-toggle\">☰</button></div></header><main class=\"legacy-page\" data-testid=\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Article\", \"headline\": \"LED Wall Buyer's Checklist: 12 Questions to Ask Your Supplier\", \"description\": \"The 12 questions that separate serious LED suppliers from traders \\u2014 covering warranty, spares, calibration, compliance and after-sales support in the UAE.\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/blog/led-wall-buyers-checklist\", \"image\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/brightluxx/site-images/opt_fam_signatouch.webp\", \"author\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"publisher\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"datePublished\": \"2026-08-19\", \"dateModified\": \"2026-08-19\", \"articleSection\": \"LED Display Technology\"}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What questions should I ask an LED display supplier?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Ask about factory source and reference projects, calibrated brightness, refresh rate, front-serviceability, warranty scope, local spare-parts stock, fault response SLA, on-site calibration, and who handles municipality/DEWA approvals.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What should an LED display warranty in the UAE cover?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A proper warranty covers modules, power supplies and receiving cards for at least 2 years (extendable to 5), with spare modules stocked locally in the UAE and a written response-time SLA.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How do I know if an LED supplier is a trader or a real integrator?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Ask to visit their showroom, see a delivered project at a real address, and meet the installation team. Traders have none of the three; integrators offer all of them the same week.\"}}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Blog\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/blog\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"LED Wall Buyer's Checklist: 12 Questions to Ask Your Supplier\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/blog/led-wall-buyers-checklist\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Organization\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"legalName\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"contactPoint\": {\"@type\": \"ContactPoint\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"contactType\": \"sales\", \"areaServed\": [\"AE\", \"SA\", \"QA\", \"KW\", \"BH\", \"OM\"], \"availableLanguage\": [\"en\", \"ar\"]}}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"LocalBusiness\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"image\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"priceRange\": \"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\u00b2\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"geo\": {\"@type\": \"GeoCoordinates\", \"latitude\": 24.9857, \"longitude\": 55.0272}, \"openingHoursSpecification\": {\"@type\": \"OpeningHoursSpecification\", \"dayOfWeek\": [\"Monday\", \"Tuesday\", \"Wednesday\", \"Thursday\", \"Friday\", \"Saturday\"], \"opens\": \"09:00\", \"closes\": \"18:00\"}, \"areaServed\": [\"Dubai\", \"Abu Dhabi\", \"United Arab Emirates\", \"Saudi Arabia\", \"Qatar\", \"Kuwait\", \"Bahrain\", \"Oman\"]}</script><article class=\"legacy-page__content\"><h1>LED Wall</h1><p>Blog — Led Wall Buyers Checklist. Premium LED display solutions by Brightluxx in Dubai, UAE.</p><p>The 12 questions that separate serious LED suppliers from traders — covering warranty, spares, calibration, compliance and after-sales support in the UAE.</p><div><h2>Why you need a checklist</h2><p>Most LED wall problems are bought, not built: the wrong pitch, a trader with no spares, a warranty that excludes everything. Ask every shortlisted supplier these 12 questions — in writing — and compare answers side by side.</p><h2>Product questions</h2><ol><li><strong>Which factory makes your panels, and can I see a delivered project?</strong> Traders dodge this; manufacturers and factory partners answer instantly with addresses.</li><li><strong>What is the panel's brightness after calibration, not peak?</strong> Calibrated brightness is typically 70–80% of the datasheet number.</li><li><strong>What refresh rate — and is it enough for cameras?</strong> 3840Hz minimum if the screen will ever be filmed.</li><li><strong>Are modules front-serviceable?</strong> Rear-access-only walls cost far more to maintain once installed against a wall.</li><li><strong>What's the pixel pitch for my actual viewing distance?</strong> Check it yourself with a <a href=\"/viewing-distance\">viewing distance calculator</a>.</li></ol><h2>Warranty and after-sales — where UAE buyers get burned</h2><ol start=\"6\"><li><strong>What does your LED display warranty in the UAE actually cover?</strong> It must include modules, power supplies and receiving cards; ask for exclusions in writing.</li><li><strong>Where are spare modules stocked?</strong> \"In China\" means a 4–8 week wait with a hole in your screen. Local UAE stock should be included with the project.</li><li><strong>What's the guaranteed response time for a fault?</strong> Get an SLA in the contract, not a verbal promise.</li><li><strong>Do you calibrate on site after installation?</strong> Batch-matched, camera-calibrated walls look seamless; uncalibrated ones show patchwork tiles within months.</li></ol><h2>Compliance and commercial</h2><ol start=\"10\"><li><strong>Who handles municipality, DED and DEWA approvals?</strong> In Dubai these are mandatory for external signage — see our <a href=\"/dubai\">Dubai regulations overview</a>.</li><li><strong>Is structure, power and content management included or excluded?</strong> The cheapest panel quote is often the most expensive project.</li><li><strong>Can I visit your showroom and see my content on a demo wall?</strong> If there's no showroom, ask why. Ours is in Jebel Ali — <a href=\"/contact\">book a visit</a>.</li></ol><p>Want the full pricing context before you meet suppliers? Read the <a href=\"/blog/led-display-pricing-guide-uae\">UAE LED pricing guide</a> and size your wall with our <a href=\"/tools/led-wall-size-calculator\">wall size calculator</a>.</p></div><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What questions should I ask an LED display supplier?</h3><p>Ask about factory source and reference projects, calibrated brightness, refresh rate, front-serviceability, warranty scope, local spare-parts stock, fault response SLA, on-site calibration, and who handles municipality/DEWA approvals.</p><h3>What should an LED display warranty in the UAE cover?</h3><p>A proper warranty covers modules, power supplies and receiving cards for at least 2 years (extendable to 5), with spare modules stocked locally in the UAE and a written response-time SLA.</p><h3>How do I know if an LED supplier is a trader or a real integrator?</h3><p>Ask to visit their showroom, see a delivered project at a real address, and meet the installation team. Traders have none of the three; integrators offer all of them the same week.</p></article><section class=\"seo-content-block\" data-testid=\"seo-content-block\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Specification guidance</p><h2>LED Wall<!-- --> — project planning</h2><div class=\"seo-content-block__copy\"><p>Blog — Led Wall Buyers Checklist. Premium LED display solutions by Brightluxx in Dubai, UAE.<!-- --> Brightluxx helps teams translate viewing distance, ambient light, operating hours and site constraints into an LED display specification that can be installed, maintained and expanded with confidence.</p><p>Start with the audience and environment, then confirm pixel pitch, brightness, processing, power access and serviceability. Our engineering team can review drawings, recommend a suitable display family and coordinate the practical requirements for delivery and commissioning.</p></div><nav class=\"seo-content-block__links\" aria-label=\"Related Brightluxx resources\"><a data-testid=\"seo-internal-link-products\" href=\"/products\">Explore LED displays<span>→</span></a><a data-testid=\"seo-internal-link-solutions\" href=\"/solutions\">Plan a solution<span>→</span></a><a data-testid=\"seo-internal-link-resources\" href=\"/resources\">Technical resources<span>→</span></a><a data-testid=\"seo-internal-link-contact\" href=\"/contact\">Talk to an engineer<span>→</span></a></nav></section></main><!--$--><!--/$--><footer class=\"site-footer\" data-testid=\"footer\"><div class=\"site-footer__inner\"><section class=\"site-footer__brand\"><a href=\"/\"><img src=\"https://files.ihgbrands.com/assets_brightluxx-logo-nav.png\" alt=\"Brightluxx\"/></a><p>Premium LED display solutions for UAE and MENA. Established since 2005.</p><div><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/brightluxx/\" aria-label=\"Instagram\" data-testid=\"footer-social-instagram\">◎</a><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/brightluxx/\" aria-label=\"LinkedIn\" data-testid=\"footer-social-linkedin\">in</a></div></section><section><h2>EXPLORE</h2><a href=\"/products\">PRODUCTS</a><a href=\"/solutions\">SOLUTIONS</a><a href=\"/technology\">TECHNOLOGY</a><a href=\"/case-studies\">CASE STUDIES</a><a href=\"/blog\">BLOG</a></section><section><h2>LOCATIONS</h2><a href=\"/dubai\">DUBAI</a><a href=\"/abu-dhabi\">ABU DHABI</a><a href=\"/saudi-arabia\">SAUDI ARABIA</a><a href=\"/qatar\">QATAR</a><a href=\"/kuwait\">KUWAIT</a><a href=\"/bahrain\">BAHRAIN</a><a href=\"/oman\">OMAN</a></section><section><h2>COMPANY</h2><a href=\"/about\">ABOUT US</a><a href=\"/contact\">CONTACT US</a><a href=\"/factory-tour\">FACTORY TOUR</a><a href=\"/faq\">FAQ</a><a href=\"/resources\">RESOURCES</a></section><section><h2>CONTACT</h2><a href=\"https://maps.google.com/?q=Jebel+Ali+Industrial+Area+1+Dubai\" data-testid=\"footer-map-link\">Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1, Dubai, UAE</a><a href=\"tel:+97142585754\" data-testid=\"footer-phone-link\">+971 4 258 5754</a><a href=\"mailto:sales@brightluxx.com\" data-testid=\"footer-email-link\">sales@brightluxx.com</a></section></div><div class=\"site-footer__bottom\">© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> BRIGHTLUXX. ALL RIGHTS RESERVED.<span>A DIVISION OF IHG INDUSTRY L.L.C</span></div></footer><a class=\"floating-whatsapp\" href=\"https://wa.me/971559954274\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" data-testid=\"global-whatsapp-link\" aria-label=\"WhatsApp\">◔</a><a class=\"floating-phone\" href=\"tel:+97142585754\" data-testid=\"global-phone-link\" aria-label=\"Call Brightluxx\">☎</a><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/310vm2bl3xxpt.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:\\\"$Sreact.suspense\\\"\\n3:I[31262,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2pj-k95c4eq-z.js\\\"],\\\"PageViewTracker\\\"]\\n4:I[48303,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2pj-k95c4eq-z.js\\\"],\\\"SiteHeader\\\"]\\n5:I[39756,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2pj-k95c4eq-z.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n6:I[37457,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2pj-k95c4eq-z.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n7:I[22016,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2pj-k95c4eq-z.js\\\"],\\\"\\\"]\\n8:I[52006,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2pj-k95c4eq-z.js\\\"],\\\"FloatingActions\\\"]\\n9:I[81888,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2pj-k95c4eq-z.js\\\"],\\\"CookieConsent\\\"]\\nb:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2pj-k95c4eq-z.js\\\"],\\\"OutletBoundary\\\"]\\ne:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2pj-k95c4eq-z.js\\\"],\\\"ViewportBoundary\\\"]\\n10:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2pj-k95c4eq-z.js\\\"],\\\"MetadataBoundary\\\"]\\n12:I[68027,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2pj-k95c4eq-z.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\",1]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/29_hqtqdgnbf4.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n:HL[\\\"https://files.ihgbrands.com/assets_brightluxx-logo-nav.png\\\",\\\"image\\\"]\\nd:X\\n0:{\\\"P\\\":null,\\\"c\\\":[\\\"\\\",\\\"blog\\\",\\\"led-wall-buyers-checklist\\\"],\\\"q\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"i\\\":false,\\\"f\\\":[[[\\\"\\\",{\\\"children\\\"